Do you plan to actually process it?

261
00:18:16,137 --> 00:18:19,056
Ask our attorney to come in.

262
00:18:22,059 --> 00:18:23,144
Sure, Mr. Kang.

263
00:18:28,024 --> 00:18:29,691
I just want to go home.

264
00:18:29,692 --> 00:18:31,818
Hey, don't be so weak.

265
00:18:31,819 --> 00:18:34,322
Woman,
we didn't bring you up like this.

266
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:36,823
I just want to be alone today.

267
00:18:36,824 --> 00:18:38,951
And all you'll do
is mope on the floor.

268
00:18:39,410 --> 00:18:41,829
You have to party on a day like this.

269
00:18:42,204 --> 00:18:44,164
Party? What kind of party?

270
00:18:44,165 --> 00:18:45,791
Ta-da.

271
00:18:47,293 --> 00:18:49,003
A binge-eating party.

272
00:18:50,421 --> 00:18:52,505
Just clear your mind and eat today.

273
00:18:52,506 --> 00:18:54,007
- Thanks.
- Thank you.

274
00:18:54,008 --> 00:18:56,009
- I'll pay with this.
- Thank you.

275
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:57,219
Sure.

276
00:18:59,096 --> 00:19:00,556
Let's go.

277
00:19:03,851 --> 00:19:05,853
You have something... Never mind.

278
00:19:06,729 --> 00:19:08,147
- That'll be 21,500 won.
- Okay.

279
00:19:09,857 --> 00:19:12,068
- Thank you.
- Enjoy.

280
00:19:14,487 --> 00:19:15,695
- What are you doing?
- What?

281
00:19:15,696 --> 00:19:17,406
- Are you coming in?
- I am.

282
00:19:21,035 --> 00:19:22,161
They're not him.

283
00:19:31,045 --> 00:19:32,088
VISITOR

284
00:19:48,688 --> 00:19:49,980
All right.

285
00:19:50,398 --> 00:19:52,066
I look perfect, as always.

286
00:19:58,864 --> 00:20:01,200
Come quickly, Attorney Kim Min-woo.

287
00:20:01,742 --> 00:20:02,743
Yes, coming.

288
00:20:07,665 --> 00:20:08,957
CELEBRITY BULLETIN BOARD

289
00:20:08,958 --> 00:20:11,377
"More funeral wreaths
arriving at Appello."

290
00:20:11,627 --> 00:20:13,713
Jeez. It's a whole mess.

291
00:20:14,088 --> 00:20:17,882
Because of Chan's big scandal
I couldn't even go to Pilates.

292
00:20:17,883 --> 00:20:20,219
He's never helpful.

293
00:20:20,928 --> 00:20:22,054
As our attorney

294
00:20:23,097 --> 00:20:24,140
what's the solution?

295
00:20:25,349 --> 00:20:27,059
When it comes to risk control

296
00:20:28,185 --> 00:20:30,146
it would be the fastest
to process her resignation.

297
00:20:35,234 --> 00:20:37,444
But if you wish to keep her on board

298
00:20:37,445 --> 00:20:38,570
sue the hate comments for defamation

299
00:20:38,571 --> 00:20:40,196
under the Information and
Communications Network Act

300
00:20:40,197 --> 00:20:42,741
and the illegal protesters
for obstruction of business

301
00:20:42,742 --> 00:20:44,160
under Article 314
of the Criminal Act.

302
00:20:46,746 --> 00:20:48,038
We may win legally

303
00:20:48,706 --> 00:20:50,958
but public opinion
against Appello could worsen, right?

304
00:20:52,209 --> 00:20:53,252
Probably.

305
00:21:00,384 --> 00:21:02,970
- We got lots of clams for the pasta.
- Yes.

306
00:21:03,179 --> 00:21:05,013
These all look great today.

307
00:21:05,014 --> 00:21:06,140
- Right?
- Yes.

308
00:21:12,897 --> 00:21:14,731
- Hey, did you see him?
- Yes.

309
00:21:14,732 --> 00:21:18,401
Her CEO took her in his arms
and got egged instead.

310
00:21:18,402 --> 00:21:19,695
"Stop immediately."

311
00:21:20,196 --> 00:21:21,529
That was so cool.

312
00:21:21,530 --> 00:21:23,866
- Even my heart skipped a beat.
- Tell me about it.

313
00:21:31,499 --> 00:21:32,541
Hey.

314
00:21:33,459 --> 00:21:34,918
Focus on eating.

315
00:21:34,919 --> 00:21:36,128
No other thoughts allowed.

316
00:21:40,883 --> 00:21:42,384
Do you two also think

317
00:21:43,093 --> 00:21:44,094
I am

318
00:21:45,346 --> 00:21:46,764
a stalker fan?

319
00:21:49,975 --> 00:21:52,520
- Namda.
- I am a fan.

320
00:21:54,522 --> 00:21:56,398
And I did get a job at his company.

321
00:21:58,984 --> 00:22:01,362
Anyone can see
that this is premeditated.

322
00:22:02,363 --> 00:22:04,573
Mr. Kang probably
thinks of me that way too.

323
00:22:05,199 --> 00:22:07,243
- Hey.
- I mean

324
00:22:07,618 --> 00:22:09,578
everyone calls me a stalker fan.

325
00:22:10,204 --> 00:22:12,956
It feels like all those years
I've spent as a fan

326
00:22:12,957 --> 00:22:14,624
have been tainted too.

327
00:22:14,625 --> 00:22:16,000
Come on.

328
00:22:16,001 --> 00:22:17,294
Who cares what others say?

329
00:22:18,337 --> 00:22:20,005
You're not like that.

330
00:22:20,214 --> 00:22:21,798
I mean, if that's the case

331
00:22:21,799 --> 00:22:23,592
are fans not allowed to get a job?

332
00:22:24,426 --> 00:22:27,136
She worked hard
to get a job at a place she wanted.

333
00:22:27,137 --> 00:22:30,349
How is that a crime?

334
00:22:53,414 --> 00:22:55,415
CELEBRITY FORUM

335
00:22:55,416 --> 00:22:56,417
What is this?

336
00:23:01,130 --> 00:23:03,673
KINDA BLURRED BUT GOT A SHOT OF HER

337
00:23:03,674 --> 00:23:04,884
ACCESS DENIED:
THIS POST HAS BEEN REPORTED

338
00:23:07,052 --> 00:23:08,136
CAME TO APPELLO AND SAW THE GIRL

339
00:23:08,137 --> 00:23:09,305
ACCESS DENIED:
THIS POST HAS BEEN REPORTED

340
00:23:12,725 --> 00:23:13,976
What a relief.

341
00:23:15,269 --> 00:23:17,980
But who reported these posts?

342
00:23:22,818 --> 00:23:25,487
Gosh. It's been so long
since I've worked that hard.

343
00:23:26,030 --> 00:23:27,197
Great work.

344
00:23:27,990 --> 00:23:29,074
Anyway...

345
00:23:30,284 --> 00:23:32,077
Do you have to go this far?

346
00:23:33,245 --> 00:23:34,412
What?

347
00:23:34,413 --> 00:23:37,082
Must you take everyone down
so mercilessly?

348
00:23:43,631 --> 00:23:44,673
Hey.

349
00:23:46,926 --> 00:23:48,218
Jeez.

350
00:24:00,147 --> 00:24:01,357
Why, you...

351
00:24:01,857 --> 00:24:04,401
Do you know what we had
to go through because of you?

352
00:24:06,987 --> 00:24:07,988
We need to talk.

353
00:24:12,368 --> 00:24:13,786
I'll talk to you later.

354
00:24:28,300 --> 00:24:29,385
What about Da-reum?

355
00:24:35,182 --> 00:24:36,183
"Da-reum"?

356
00:24:37,810 --> 00:24:39,979
So you'll stop pretending
in front of me now?

357
00:24:43,107 --> 00:24:44,691
Was she okay at work today?

358
00:24:44,692 --> 00:24:47,026
Where's your responsibility
as the company's director?

359
00:24:47,027 --> 00:24:48,487
Look at what it has come to.

360
00:24:51,198 --> 00:24:53,993
I'm sorry.
A correction will be issued soon.

361
00:24:56,036 --> 00:24:57,746
Do you think saying sorry is enough?

362
00:25:01,583 --> 00:25:03,544
What about the hundreds of people
at Appello?

363
00:25:05,045 --> 00:25:06,504
Have you thought of them?

364
00:25:06,505 --> 00:25:07,756
Da-reum and I...

365
00:25:10,342 --> 00:25:11,635
aren't dating.

366
00:25:12,011 --> 00:25:13,512
And she's not a stalker fan.

367
00:25:14,388 --> 00:25:16,180
I didn't want you to misunderstand.

368
00:25:16,181 --> 00:25:18,100
You've already
blown this way out of proportion.

369
00:25:19,351 --> 00:25:22,563
The company lost its trust,
and Da-reum got publicly humiliated.

370
00:25:22,771 --> 00:25:24,898
She's now branded
and suffering from insults.

371
00:25:28,569 --> 00:25:29,611
At the very least

372
00:25:31,238 --> 00:25:32,906
you should've told me.

373
00:25:37,703 --> 00:25:38,704
What about you?

374
00:25:40,831 --> 00:25:42,166
Do you tell me everything?

375
00:25:48,505 --> 00:25:50,049
I heard about your mother's accident

376
00:25:50,799 --> 00:25:52,217
from another person.

377
00:25:55,137 --> 00:25:56,305
What about Jeong-yeon?

378
00:25:58,724 --> 00:26:01,852
Were you honest when I asked
how you felt about Da-reum?

379
00:26:04,021 --> 00:26:05,022
Hey.

380
00:26:08,567 --> 00:26:10,277
Do you even think of me as a friend?

381
00:26:20,871 --> 00:26:22,915
If investors keep pressuring you,
I'll step down.

382
00:26:23,832 --> 00:26:25,084
I'll take responsibility.

383
00:26:30,506 --> 00:26:31,507
"Responsibility"?

384
00:26:32,883 --> 00:26:34,426
Then put out this fire
you've started.

385
00:26:38,931 --> 00:26:40,640
Boycott Appello!

386
00:26:40,641 --> 00:26:42,350
- Boycott Appello!
- Boycott Appello!

387
00:26:42,351 --> 00:26:43,935
Kick out the obsessive fan!

388
00:26:43,936 --> 00:26:45,561
- Kick her out!
- Kick her out!

389
00:26:45,562 --> 00:26:47,480
Boycott Appello!

390
00:26:47,481 --> 00:26:49,149
- Boycott Appello!
- Boycott Appello!

391
00:26:49,775 --> 00:26:53,986
I mean, is Director Lee Chan
even thinking right now?

392
00:26:53,987 --> 00:26:56,072
SE Corporation is
advertising to the world

393
00:26:56,073 --> 00:26:57,740
that they're opening
their fashion platform soon.

394
00:26:57,741 --> 00:26:59,700
How can he cause
a boycott at this time?

395
00:26:59,701 --> 00:27:01,035
Yes, we're aware.

396
00:27:01,036 --> 00:27:02,870
I understand your anxiety
as investors

397
00:27:02,871 --> 00:27:04,247
but give us a little more time.

398
00:27:04,248 --> 00:27:06,249
After the correction report,
things are dying down...

399
00:27:06,250 --> 00:27:07,708
What are you talking about?

400
00:27:07,709 --> 00:27:09,168
They're making a scene out there!

401
00:27:09,169 --> 00:27:11,629
How can the company's value falter
just because of one employee?

402
00:27:11,630 --> 00:27:14,882
Yes, realistically speaking,
if she's our risk at the moment

403
00:27:14,883 --> 00:27:16,217
they must get rid of her.

404
00:27:16,218 --> 00:27:17,760
- Fire her.
- Do that.

405
00:27:17,761 --> 00:27:20,013
Are you asking us
to give in to the public sentiment

406
00:27:21,223 --> 00:27:23,182
even though
the allegations weren't factual?

407
00:27:23,183 --> 00:27:24,642
Don't you know
the words "emotional damage"?

408
00:27:24,643 --> 00:27:27,770
When consumers don't like something,
you must always grovel.

409
00:27:27,771 --> 00:27:29,605
Grovel? That is so wrong.

410
00:27:29,606 --> 00:27:31,065
We released a correction report.

411
00:27:31,066 --> 00:27:32,608
Now, settle down.

412
00:27:32,609 --> 00:27:35,070
- People are boycotting you.
- That's not it.

413
00:27:37,739 --> 00:27:39,199
That'll settle this for now.

414
00:27:40,367 --> 00:27:41,535
And then what?

415
00:27:41,827 --> 00:27:43,161
- Fire her!
- Fire her!

416
00:27:43,162 --> 00:27:44,912
Fire the stalker fan!

417
00:27:44,913 --> 00:27:46,539
- Fire her!
- Fire her!

418
00:27:46,540 --> 00:27:48,208
Boycott Appello!

419
00:27:48,792 --> 00:27:50,878
Then we will be shaken
whenever something like this happens

420
00:27:51,545 --> 00:27:53,254
and even abandon
someone important to us.

421
00:27:53,255 --> 00:27:54,505
Mr. Kang.

422
00:27:54,506 --> 00:27:56,841
This isn't the time
to discuss your idealism.

423
00:27:56,842 --> 00:27:58,093
I am talking about standards.

424
00:27:59,052 --> 00:28:02,014
Ms. Nam is a competent employee
who performed well during her time.

425
00:28:02,556 --> 00:28:05,893
Shouldn't we see this as a management
issue, not an individual one?

426
00:28:06,602 --> 00:28:08,270
- What now?
- How can he say that?

427
00:28:09,354 --> 00:28:10,731
No matter what the decision is

428
00:28:11,732 --> 00:28:12,858
I will take responsibility.

429
00:28:13,942 --> 00:28:15,319
- Responsibility?
- He will?

430
00:28:16,403 --> 00:28:18,112
I am the one leading Appello

431
00:28:18,113 --> 00:28:19,865
and I've already proven it
with our performances.

432
00:28:20,824 --> 00:28:21,992
All right.

433
00:28:22,201 --> 00:28:24,536
The opening of SE's platform
will be your testing ground.

434
00:28:25,204 --> 00:28:27,289
We'll see
if you can still keep your position.

435
00:28:30,334 --> 00:28:31,376
I will show you

436
00:28:32,794 --> 00:28:33,795
with the results.

437
00:28:43,597 --> 00:28:44,681
Mr. Kang.

438
00:28:54,358 --> 00:28:56,026
Are you sure about this?

439
00:28:56,485 --> 00:28:57,527
What?

440
00:28:58,403 --> 00:29:01,615
I think I understand
the decision you have made.

441
00:29:03,242 --> 00:29:04,326
Then be my support.

442
00:29:04,826 --> 00:29:05,869
Mr. Kang.

443
00:29:06,954 --> 00:29:10,207
Yes, I will do that
as one of your employees.

444
00:29:11,291 --> 00:29:13,043
But let me say this as a friend.

445
00:29:14,336 --> 00:29:16,213
Ha-gi, if this continues

446
00:29:16,922 --> 00:29:18,715
your position as the CEO
will be in jeopardy.

447
00:29:24,179 --> 00:29:25,806
Let me see the investors off.

448
00:29:44,199 --> 00:29:45,826
There are so many things to do.

449
00:29:46,410 --> 00:29:48,453
I hope
the preparations are going well.

450
00:29:53,375 --> 00:29:54,376
I mean

451
00:29:55,252 --> 00:29:57,337
my absence won't have an impact
on the company as a whole.

452
00:30:05,012 --> 00:30:06,179
MASTER IM CHEONG-RIM

453
00:30:09,016 --> 00:30:10,600
MASTER IM CHEONG-RIM

454
00:30:11,518 --> 00:30:12,978
Hello, Master Im.

455
00:30:13,312 --> 00:30:16,522
Hello, Ms. Nam.
This is Im Cheong-rim calling.

456
00:30:16,523 --> 00:30:18,275
Yes, please speak, ma'am.

457
00:30:18,692 --> 00:30:20,777
How is the preparation going
for the event?

458
00:30:24,239 --> 00:30:28,076
Of course. I was just busy
because of the preparations.

459
00:30:28,410 --> 00:30:29,744
MS. NAM DA-REUM

460
00:30:29,745 --> 00:30:33,205
Have you received
the project proposal and the samples?

461
00:30:33,206 --> 00:30:36,209
Well, it wasn't half bad.

462
00:30:37,169 --> 00:30:39,837
She loves that she gets to do
the event with Lee Chan.

463
00:30:39,838 --> 00:30:40,964
Quiet.

464
00:30:41,506 --> 00:30:43,466
Anyway.

465
00:30:43,467 --> 00:30:46,802
I wanted to share some of my input,
so I sent you an email.

466
00:30:46,803 --> 00:30:50,723
I'll be in Seoul in a few days,
so we'll talk more then.

467
00:30:50,724 --> 00:30:53,560
Right. Yes, I'll check my email.

468
00:30:53,810 --> 00:30:56,730
Yes. Goodbye.

469
00:31:03,737 --> 00:31:05,072
What do I do?

470
00:31:07,532 --> 00:31:08,742
Get it together, Da-reum.

471
00:31:09,493 --> 00:31:10,619
This is not the time for this.

472
00:31:13,663 --> 00:31:15,331
REVISION REQUEST
FOR APPELLO'S SHOWROOM

473
00:31:15,332 --> 00:31:16,666
I ATTACH MY REVISIONS BELOW
SEE YOU SOON IN SEOUL

474
00:31:23,256 --> 00:31:24,257
Come in.

475
00:31:25,759 --> 00:31:26,760
Mr. Kang.

476
00:31:27,052 --> 00:31:30,180
Master Im must've sent her feedback.

477
00:31:32,224 --> 00:31:35,852
Da-reum put together her requests
and sent them over.

478
00:31:36,228 --> 00:31:38,021
Please check your email.

479
00:31:40,023 --> 00:31:41,483
- Okay.
- All right.

480
00:31:50,242 --> 00:31:51,742
POP-UP REVISIONS, MEETING IN SEOUL

481
00:31:51,743 --> 00:31:53,829
THIS IS NAM DA-REUM OF MARKETING

482
00:31:59,251 --> 00:32:01,293
KNOTTING SHOWROOM REVISION REPORT

483
00:32:01,294 --> 00:32:02,754
NAM DA-REUM

484
00:32:06,675 --> 00:32:08,885
TOP VIEW OF THE SHOWROOM
WITH MASTER IM'S REVISION REQUESTS

485
00:32:11,096 --> 00:32:12,389
Let's do this together.

486
00:32:12,639 --> 00:32:14,849
You've got to smile
when things get tough.

487
00:32:14,850 --> 00:32:18,979
Don't you know
smiling actually makes things better?

488
00:32:26,570 --> 00:32:27,654
But Mom.

489
00:32:28,405 --> 00:32:30,365
It's a small company.

490
00:32:31,408 --> 00:32:32,409
I feel...

491
00:32:34,286 --> 00:32:37,122
like I can be of use here.

492
00:32:37,789 --> 00:32:39,958
That's why I like Appello

493
00:32:41,710 --> 00:32:43,587
and I'm happier here.

494
00:32:47,257 --> 00:32:48,341
I don't want to be

495
00:32:49,426 --> 00:32:51,011
a nuisance to the company.

496
00:33:07,235 --> 00:33:09,362
CEO KANG HA-GI

497
00:33:49,736 --> 00:33:53,198
The office feels so empty
without Da-reum.

498
00:33:53,532 --> 00:33:55,408
She always spread
positive energy at work.

499
00:33:56,826 --> 00:33:58,078
I know.

500
00:33:59,454 --> 00:34:02,040
I really miss Da-reum.

501
00:34:02,874 --> 00:34:06,127
She looked like she was barely
eating these days.

502
00:34:07,379 --> 00:34:09,756
I wonder if she's going to be okay.

503
00:34:10,215 --> 00:34:12,259
We have to worry
about the event first.

504
00:34:12,634 --> 00:34:18,765
- I'm completely clueless.
- Me neither.

505
00:34:21,184 --> 00:34:25,272
Should we ask Da-reum for help?

506
00:34:27,357 --> 00:34:28,358
Shall we?

507
00:34:29,150 --> 00:34:30,151
Let's do that.

508
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:47,127
POST

509
00:34:51,298 --> 00:34:52,882
Reporter Do Eun-young is
the one who first reported it.

510
00:34:53,258 --> 00:34:54,758
Sort it out in person.

511
00:34:54,759 --> 00:34:55,969
You can do that much.

512
00:35:01,182 --> 00:35:04,603
Yes, the massage felt especially
good today.

513
00:35:05,145 --> 00:35:07,396
Oh, no need to thank me.

514
00:35:07,397 --> 00:35:09,941
I should thank you for the scoop
on the scandal.

515
00:35:10,317 --> 00:35:11,359
I...

516
00:35:14,237 --> 00:35:16,364
I'll call you back.

517
00:35:19,451 --> 00:35:21,870
I read your article,
Reporter Do Eun-young.

518
00:35:23,288 --> 00:35:25,664
Doesn't Cho-yi come here too?

519
00:35:25,665 --> 00:35:28,876
You must be rich.

520
00:35:28,877 --> 00:35:32,046
A luxury spa membership
and the latest designer items.

521
00:35:32,047 --> 00:35:33,214
You really went all out.

522
00:35:40,055 --> 00:35:41,640
So you knew everything
before you came.

523
00:35:44,601 --> 00:35:45,644
If you could

524
00:35:46,686 --> 00:35:49,188
publish a series
of exclusives like this

525
00:35:49,189 --> 00:35:50,857
you two must be pretty close.

526
00:35:51,149 --> 00:35:52,150
So?

527
00:35:53,818 --> 00:35:55,235
Why are you here?

528
00:35:55,236 --> 00:35:56,488
You need to publish
a correction article.

529
00:36:00,992 --> 00:36:02,993
She's not a stalker fan.

530
00:36:02,994 --> 00:36:06,747
Corrections are made only
when the article is clearly false.

531
00:36:06,748 --> 00:36:08,750
Because it is clearly false

532
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:10,835
I came here to tell you in person.

533
00:36:14,422 --> 00:36:15,674
What if I say no?

534
00:36:17,300 --> 00:36:18,802
I've got a tip-off for you too.

535
00:36:19,969 --> 00:36:22,721
"Following the article's publication

536
00:36:22,722 --> 00:36:25,433
are luxury spa treatments
and designer gifts."

537
00:36:26,476 --> 00:36:27,519
How does that sound?

538
00:36:32,357 --> 00:36:34,984
Is an actor threatening the press?

539
00:36:35,610 --> 00:36:36,611
Because I am an actor.

540
00:36:38,154 --> 00:36:40,824
If I open my mouth,
it'll cause quite an impact.

541
00:36:43,952 --> 00:36:46,454
Maybe I can try adjusting the tone.

542
00:36:47,706 --> 00:36:49,081
Without the word "stalker fan."

543
00:36:49,082 --> 00:36:50,583
I want a correction

544
00:36:52,043 --> 00:36:53,253
not an adjustment.

545
00:37:08,810 --> 00:37:09,935
QUICK DELIVERY

546
00:37:09,936 --> 00:37:10,979
HIRING DELIVERY DRIVERS

547
00:37:14,065 --> 00:37:15,650
He should've been here at least once.

548
00:37:29,789 --> 00:37:33,000
Where is everyone?

549
00:37:33,001 --> 00:37:35,336
There are so many calls. Jeez.

550
00:37:36,212 --> 00:37:37,379
Gosh.

551
00:37:37,380 --> 00:37:40,299
- Is this the one calling?
- Yes, that's right.

552
00:37:40,300 --> 00:37:41,675
But I'm starving.

553
00:37:41,676 --> 00:37:44,304
- I don't even have time to eat.
- Hurry up and get going.

554
00:37:45,346 --> 00:37:46,389
Hurry.

555
00:37:46,598 --> 00:37:47,724
Oh, jeez.

556
00:37:49,058 --> 00:37:51,436
Excuse me.

557
00:37:51,811 --> 00:37:54,021
Among the delivery drivers here...

558
00:37:54,022 --> 00:37:56,398
- What took you so long?
- What?

559
00:37:56,399 --> 00:37:57,858
This is perfect.

560
00:37:57,859 --> 00:37:59,943
You have a helmet.
Are you using a bicycle?

561
00:37:59,944 --> 00:38:03,322
I parked my bicycle right outside.

562
00:38:03,323 --> 00:38:05,240
Delivery by bicycle isn't so bad.

563
00:38:05,241 --> 00:38:07,826
- No, I...
- It's all in the neighborhood.

564
00:38:07,827 --> 00:38:09,453
- You'll be fine.
- No.

565
00:38:09,454 --> 00:38:12,289
- It's not so hard.
- That's not why I'm here.

566
00:38:12,290 --> 00:38:15,250
It's Fiery Chicken Feet
by the intersection.

567
00:38:15,251 --> 00:38:17,127
Go as fast as you can.

568
00:38:17,128 --> 00:38:19,421
- Okay?
- Wait. That's not why I'm here.

569
00:38:19,422 --> 00:38:21,215
- I'm here to find someone...
- Okay. I hear you.

570
00:38:21,216 --> 00:38:22,925
- I need to find someone...
- Okay. All right.

571
00:38:22,926 --> 00:38:25,177
Will you please listen to me?

572
00:38:25,178 --> 00:38:27,347
I won't charge you fees for now.

573
00:38:27,597 --> 00:38:28,681
Thank you.

574
00:38:28,973 --> 00:38:31,976
No, sir. Wait...

575
00:38:40,318 --> 00:38:41,652
Bye-bye.

576
00:38:41,653 --> 00:38:43,780
FIERY CHICKEN FEET

577
00:38:46,199 --> 00:38:48,576
If he doesn't show up,
I'll go find him.

578
00:38:51,996 --> 00:38:55,083
Roy, if you're not coming,
I'll go to you.

579
00:38:55,875 --> 00:38:57,418
Wait for me!

580
00:39:14,811 --> 00:39:17,188
FIERY CHICKEN FEET

581
00:39:39,878 --> 00:39:41,963
APPELLO CARES MORE ABOUT STALKER FANS
THAN LEE CHAN'S SAFETY

582
00:40:01,691 --> 00:40:02,734
It feels like

583
00:40:05,069 --> 00:40:06,362
I shouldn't be here.

584
00:40:17,290 --> 00:40:20,501
APPELLO CARES MORE ABOUT STALKER FANS
THAN LEE CHAN'S SAFETY

585
00:40:37,185 --> 00:40:38,811
- Did you mean this?
- Yes.

586
00:40:41,940 --> 00:40:44,442
- Don't say anything.
- What?

587
00:40:46,152 --> 00:40:47,569
- Min-a...
- Shush.

588
00:40:47,570 --> 00:40:49,822
- Don't say a word.
- What?

589
00:40:53,618 --> 00:40:55,745
Wait. What are you doing?

590
00:40:56,037 --> 00:40:57,121
Ta-da.

591
00:40:58,414 --> 00:41:03,294
- Da-reum, I missed you so much.
- We were so worried about you.

592
00:41:03,586 --> 00:41:06,673
Me too. I missed you so much.

593
00:41:08,883 --> 00:41:10,760
I was actually worried about this.

594
00:41:12,053 --> 00:41:15,389
Let me explain Master Im's requests
and the updated route.

595
00:41:15,390 --> 00:41:18,726
I applied Master Im's requests
to the design.

596
00:41:19,477 --> 00:41:21,645
Especially here.

597
00:41:21,646 --> 00:41:24,815
- The demonstration space...
- Ms. Da-reum.

598
00:41:24,816 --> 00:41:28,069
How can you worry about the company
after all that?

599
00:41:28,194 --> 00:41:29,654
What about you?

600
00:41:32,615 --> 00:41:34,534
After spending a few days at home

601
00:41:35,451 --> 00:41:37,537
I realized
waking up in the morning for work

602
00:41:37,954 --> 00:41:40,415
made me happy.

603
00:41:40,999 --> 00:41:43,835
I tried not to think about the event,
but I just couldn't.

604
00:41:44,460 --> 00:41:45,628
Typical of you.

605
00:41:51,009 --> 00:41:52,260
How is...

606
00:41:53,302 --> 00:41:54,720
Mr. Kang?

607
00:41:54,721 --> 00:41:58,057
Mr. Kang doesn't really talk much.

608
00:41:58,266 --> 00:41:59,976
He's been working even harder.

609
00:42:00,685 --> 00:42:02,854
I don't know what he's thinking.

610
00:42:15,867 --> 00:42:18,661
INGUK STATION

611
00:43:29,524 --> 00:43:30,608
What am I doing here?

612
00:43:38,950 --> 00:43:40,034
Mr. Kang?

613
00:43:48,126 --> 00:43:50,878
What brings you here?

614
00:43:53,381 --> 00:43:54,423
I...

615
00:44:00,221 --> 00:44:02,098
I was on my way home.

616
00:44:04,392 --> 00:44:05,726
You pass this way?

617
00:44:06,936 --> 00:44:08,062
Yeah, well...

618
00:44:11,357 --> 00:44:12,900
We live in the same neighborhood,
after all.

619
00:44:13,651 --> 00:44:15,735
It's only normal for us
to run into each other.

620
00:44:15,736 --> 00:44:16,737
Anyway...

621
00:44:18,573 --> 00:44:19,740
I'm on my way home.

622
00:44:24,036 --> 00:44:26,372
Have you been well?

623
00:44:28,499 --> 00:44:30,126
Yeah, well...

624
00:44:33,671 --> 00:44:34,672
What about you?

625
00:44:35,631 --> 00:44:36,841
Have you been well?

626
00:44:41,971 --> 00:44:42,972
No.

627
00:44:49,687 --> 00:44:50,688
If...

628
00:44:51,397 --> 00:44:52,899
you're here to see me

629
00:44:53,482 --> 00:44:55,151
feel free to talk to me, Mr. Kang.

630
00:44:56,986 --> 00:44:58,070
What do you mean?

631
00:44:59,113 --> 00:45:00,907
I won't blame you
even if you fire me.

632
00:45:01,824 --> 00:45:04,243
I submitted my resignation
to take responsibility.

633
00:45:04,911 --> 00:45:06,328
It's best for the company
to make an official...

634
00:45:06,329 --> 00:45:07,705
What are you saying?

635
00:45:13,002 --> 00:45:14,128
I've been

636
00:45:14,962 --> 00:45:16,714
sorting out my feelings.

637
00:45:21,636 --> 00:45:22,803
I'll be okay.

638
00:45:23,304 --> 00:45:25,223
Why do you say that
when you're not okay?

639
00:45:26,224 --> 00:45:27,600
Is that how someone who's okay looks?

640
00:45:28,684 --> 00:45:31,102
You're here to say it anyway.

641
00:45:31,103 --> 00:45:32,396
I'm here because I missed you.

642
00:45:32,855 --> 00:45:34,565
I came because I was worried.
Happy now?

643
00:45:56,963 --> 00:45:59,382
It's late.

644
00:46:03,552 --> 00:46:04,637
You should go home.

645
00:46:06,055 --> 00:46:07,056
Bye.

646
00:46:26,325 --> 00:46:28,077
He missed me?

647
00:46:59,900 --> 00:47:01,485
MR. KANG

648
00:47:05,197 --> 00:47:07,533
MR. KANG SHOWED UP OUTSIDE MY HOUSE

649
00:47:13,497 --> 00:47:14,790
FINALLY MY FIRST DAY AT APPELLO

650
00:47:16,459 --> 00:47:17,709
PROJECT OUTSTANDING EMPLOYEE

651
00:47:17,710 --> 00:47:19,377
BECOME MR. KANG'S SECRET AGENT

652
00:47:19,378 --> 00:47:20,838
MR. KANG

653
00:47:22,089 --> 00:47:23,257
FIRST OUTSIDE MEETING WITH MR. KANG

654
00:47:23,466 --> 00:47:24,591
I ALMOST SLIPPED,
BUT MR. KANG HELD ME

655
00:47:24,592 --> 00:47:25,634
MR. KANG HELD AN UMBRELLA OVER ME

656
00:47:27,303 --> 00:47:30,598
MR. KANG

657
00:47:31,807 --> 00:47:34,727
MR. KANG

658
00:47:38,356 --> 00:47:40,565
I CAN'T STOP THINKING ABOUT MR. KANG

659
00:47:40,566 --> 00:47:43,194
HE SAID IT WAS NICE TO SEE ME AGAIN
WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?

660
00:47:47,823 --> 00:47:49,033
Why...

661
00:47:49,784 --> 00:47:52,995
I only wrote about Mr. Kang.

662
00:48:13,182 --> 00:48:16,477
Mr. Kang. Why are you
so serious about this?

663
00:48:16,811 --> 00:48:19,771
We have a goal. We want Jjak.

664
00:48:19,772 --> 00:48:21,232
Kung and Jjak left

665
00:48:21,899 --> 00:48:23,150
but you can still contact me

666
00:48:25,194 --> 00:48:26,487
for no reason.

667
00:48:33,494 --> 00:48:34,787
What's wrong with me?

668
00:49:03,774 --> 00:49:04,984
Reporter Do Eun-young

669
00:49:06,193 --> 00:49:07,236
won't be coming.

670
00:49:07,736 --> 00:49:09,405
I got her
something bigger than you did.

671
00:49:14,452 --> 00:49:15,453
Cho-yi.

672
00:49:16,996 --> 00:49:18,289
Stop crossing the line.

673
00:49:19,832 --> 00:49:20,958
That's what I'm here to say.

674
00:49:21,375 --> 00:49:22,376
What?

675
00:49:26,505 --> 00:49:28,632
If you mess with her again

676
00:49:30,384 --> 00:49:31,760
I won't let it slide.

677
00:49:35,848 --> 00:49:36,849
So?

678
00:49:39,143 --> 00:49:42,313
Are you doing this to me
to protect that one girl?

679
00:49:43,189 --> 00:49:45,858
Chan, get a hold of yourself.

680
00:49:46,734 --> 00:49:48,736
Do you know
how much that degraded you?

681
00:49:49,361 --> 00:49:51,113
What if you got involved
in a scandal with me?

682
00:49:51,655 --> 00:49:53,698
Well, people will still be jealous.

683
00:49:53,699 --> 00:49:55,534
But people would've said
we made a good couple.

684
00:49:56,327 --> 00:49:57,536
But what about her?

685
00:49:57,786 --> 00:49:59,371
People did nothing but criticize.

686
00:50:00,539 --> 00:50:02,541
- Yoon Cho-yi...
- I told you.

687
00:50:02,791 --> 00:50:04,877
You should date someone
on your level.

688
00:50:05,669 --> 00:50:07,087
You two

689
00:50:07,546 --> 00:50:10,216
would only cause harm
to each other. Got it?

690
00:50:17,640 --> 00:50:19,016
It's up to me to deal with it

691
00:50:20,643 --> 00:50:21,644
and it's up to me to decide.

692
00:50:23,771 --> 00:50:25,022
Don't mess with Da-reum.

693
00:50:26,482 --> 00:50:27,566
This is my last warning.

694
00:50:36,867 --> 00:50:37,868
Hey.

695
00:50:38,786 --> 00:50:39,912
Lee Chan!

696
00:50:42,998 --> 00:50:44,124
Are we ready?

697
00:50:47,086 --> 00:50:49,254
Lee Chan is here with us today.

698
00:50:49,255 --> 00:50:52,299
- Thanks for the exclusive interview.
- Yes.

699
00:50:52,591 --> 00:50:55,678
First, let's start with your opinion
on the recent issue.

700
00:50:59,265 --> 00:51:01,141
I should've known better
as a public figure.

701
00:51:01,809 --> 00:51:02,810
She was...

702
00:51:03,811 --> 00:51:06,188
never a stalker fan.

703
00:51:07,189 --> 00:51:10,066
She's a fan who cares about me
just like all my other fans

704
00:51:10,067 --> 00:51:11,110
but she's also my co-worker.

705
00:51:11,735 --> 00:51:14,572
Nothing more, nothing less?

706
00:51:16,031 --> 00:51:17,032
That's correct.

707
00:51:18,701 --> 00:51:20,703
I hope loving someone

708
00:51:21,245 --> 00:51:23,664
doesn't become a reason
to be criticized.

709
00:51:25,541 --> 00:51:27,126
And I hope everyone stops

710
00:51:28,127 --> 00:51:29,712
criticizing her.

711
00:51:31,338 --> 00:51:33,257
Any word for your fans?

712
00:51:40,514 --> 00:51:42,391
I'm sorry, and thank you.

713
00:51:44,560 --> 00:51:46,270
I cherish the time

714
00:51:47,146 --> 00:51:48,897
you spent loving me.

715
00:51:50,107 --> 00:51:53,319
Thanks to all your love,
I could be where I am today.

716
00:52:01,452 --> 00:52:03,162
I hope we continue
to support each other...

717
00:52:05,164 --> 00:52:06,707
and stay on good terms.

718
00:52:17,259 --> 00:52:19,887
KNOT

719
00:52:26,727 --> 00:52:29,062
Just as you requested

720
00:52:29,063 --> 00:52:32,566
we prepared the display, story,
and the experience zones.

721
00:52:32,941 --> 00:52:35,235
We also made changes to the kit.

722
00:52:36,070 --> 00:52:37,779
We've arranged it to reflect the idea

723
00:52:37,780 --> 00:52:40,574
of Appello continuing
the tradition of your knot.

724
00:52:46,872 --> 00:52:47,956
Where's Ms. Nam Da-reum?

725
00:52:51,085 --> 00:52:54,171
It's her day off today.

726
00:52:54,546 --> 00:52:57,466
We promised to teach her a new knot.

727
00:52:58,258 --> 00:53:00,302
We picked the wrong day, Master Im.

728
00:53:06,642 --> 00:53:09,186
Perhaps because I kept pushing her

729
00:53:10,604 --> 00:53:12,272
she did a good job.

730
00:53:15,984 --> 00:53:17,903
Tell her she did well.

731
00:53:18,987 --> 00:53:20,030
Yes, Master Im.

732
00:53:24,660 --> 00:53:28,204
Master Im, will you check
the exhibition display?

733
00:53:28,205 --> 00:53:30,124
- Sure.
- Right...

734
00:54:24,678 --> 00:54:26,388
You look gaunt.

735
00:54:27,931 --> 00:54:29,349
You must've gone through a lot.

736
00:54:31,310 --> 00:54:32,352
No.

737
00:54:33,103 --> 00:54:37,024
I feel bad for leaving the team
before the event.

738
00:54:38,984 --> 00:54:41,361
When are you
going to come back to work?

739
00:54:43,572 --> 00:54:45,282
How can I do that?

740
00:54:46,283 --> 00:54:47,826
There are still so many people

741
00:54:48,452 --> 00:54:51,037
criticizing the company
because of me.

742
00:54:51,038 --> 00:54:54,082
Everyone knows
that you're not a stalker fan now.

743
00:54:56,794 --> 00:54:58,462
I asked myself

744
00:54:59,588 --> 00:55:03,759
whether I had joined Appello
with pure intentions.

745
00:55:05,928 --> 00:55:08,096
Then I thought
that might not be the case.

746
00:55:09,556 --> 00:55:10,808
I was childish enough to think

747
00:55:11,433 --> 00:55:14,978
I could see him up close
if I worked here.

748
00:55:19,525 --> 00:55:21,443
You probably
wouldn't understand though.

749
00:55:21,819 --> 00:55:23,111
Why is that childish?

750
00:55:24,071 --> 00:55:25,197
I...

751
00:55:26,615 --> 00:55:28,492
understand how you feel
better than anyone else.

752
00:55:28,784 --> 00:55:32,329
You want to get as close as you can
to your favorite star

753
00:55:32,996 --> 00:55:34,957
and you're willing
to do anything for him.

754
00:55:37,709 --> 00:55:39,293
Actually

755
00:55:39,294 --> 00:55:40,921
I was a fan of Director Lee.

756
00:55:44,508 --> 00:55:46,885
What? You?

757
00:55:47,636 --> 00:55:48,970
Yes.

758
00:55:48,971 --> 00:55:51,849
In fact, I was the first president
of the D-Angel fandom.

759
00:55:58,689 --> 00:56:00,816
Then are you...

760
00:56:19,459 --> 00:56:21,961
D-Angel's legendary first president

761
00:56:21,962 --> 00:56:26,841
who fought off the haters 17 to 1
and wiped them out completely

762
00:56:26,842 --> 00:56:29,219
in D.N.X's early days?

763
00:56:31,179 --> 00:56:34,641
Was that really you?

764
00:56:34,892 --> 00:56:38,186
It wasn't 17 to 1.
It was 19 to 1 to be exact.

765
00:56:41,398 --> 00:56:42,441
No way.

766
00:56:43,901 --> 00:56:47,362
You're the one
who created D-Angel's fan culture.

767
00:56:50,073 --> 00:56:52,659
But how did you start working
at Appello...

768
00:56:55,037 --> 00:56:57,788
When Director Lee first opened
the concept store

769
00:56:57,789 --> 00:56:59,124
he recruited me.

770
00:56:59,666 --> 00:57:02,044
At the time, I was working
at a fashion company.

771
00:57:04,922 --> 00:57:06,673
I can't say

772
00:57:07,424 --> 00:57:09,009
I didn't have
any other motives at first.

773
00:57:09,718 --> 00:57:15,015
Working with the star we admire
feels surreal to us.

774
00:57:16,266 --> 00:57:19,978
His success feels like my success.

775
00:57:21,605 --> 00:57:24,858
But over time, I realized

776
00:57:25,901 --> 00:57:27,903
what really matters is...

777
00:57:28,820 --> 00:57:30,405
who I am.

778
00:57:31,990 --> 00:57:34,660
It's about what I find fun

779
00:57:35,202 --> 00:57:37,746
and what I want to be good at.

780
00:57:38,372 --> 00:57:40,040
I'm sure

781
00:57:40,958 --> 00:57:43,126
you had the same concerns.

782
00:57:47,089 --> 00:57:48,674
Speaking of which

783
00:57:50,592 --> 00:57:52,260
you should come back to work.

784
00:57:52,511 --> 00:57:55,304
Why would you run away
when you didn't do anything wrong?

785
00:57:55,305 --> 00:57:58,433
You're the most passionate,
and you work harder than anyone else.

786
00:57:59,142 --> 00:58:00,143
Everyone is

787
00:58:01,395 --> 00:58:03,647
waiting for you.

788
00:58:11,446 --> 00:58:12,447
I wish

789
00:58:13,156 --> 00:58:14,491
I could go back.

790
00:58:16,118 --> 00:58:17,119
But that

791
00:58:17,995 --> 00:58:19,955
would put Mr. Kang in trouble.

792
00:58:22,165 --> 00:58:23,208
Haven't you seen it yet?

793
00:58:24,584 --> 00:58:25,585
Seen what?

794
00:58:26,712 --> 00:58:29,631
Mr. Kang posted
Appello's official statement.

795
00:58:30,841 --> 00:58:31,842
What?

796
00:58:35,220 --> 00:58:38,932
Actually, I'm here
because Mr. Kang asked me.

797
00:58:41,351 --> 00:58:42,561
He asked me to give you this knot.

798
00:58:43,729 --> 00:58:47,858
Do you have any idea
how much he was worried about you?

799
00:58:59,995 --> 00:59:01,538
APPELLO OFFICIAL STATEMENT

800
00:59:02,205 --> 00:59:06,375
Appello has verified the facts
regarding the matter

801
00:59:06,376 --> 00:59:08,462
involving one of our employees.

802
00:59:09,379 --> 00:59:12,841
We confirm that the employee
in question is not a stalker fan.

803
00:59:19,056 --> 00:59:22,184
In fact, the employee in question is
a dedicated and responsible member

804
00:59:22,559 --> 00:59:26,063
who has been faithfully carrying out
her duties at Appello.

805
00:59:40,911 --> 00:59:42,037
And yet

806
00:59:42,496 --> 00:59:44,664
some fans are pressuring
the employee in question to resign

807
00:59:45,123 --> 00:59:47,666
based on claims
that have been found to be false.

808
00:59:47,667 --> 00:59:49,795
- I knew he'd do it.
- See? He's good.

809
00:59:50,003 --> 00:59:51,671
Hey. Be quiet.

810
00:59:52,172 --> 00:59:55,300
Appello will not give in
to any unreasonable demands

811
00:59:55,550 --> 00:59:57,719
nor will we tolerate
any slander or threats

812
00:59:57,969 --> 00:59:59,471
against our employee.

813
00:59:59,805 --> 01:00:01,680
APPELLO'S CEO HANDLED THIS WITH CLASS

814
01:00:01,681 --> 01:00:03,474
I FEEL BAD FOR THEIR ROOKIE

815
01:00:03,475 --> 01:00:04,850
THAT IS WHAT A TRUE LEADER IS

816
01:00:04,851 --> 01:00:06,228
GOING ALL IN ON APPELLO STOCKS

817
01:00:09,397 --> 01:00:12,025
The employee in question will

818
01:00:12,984 --> 01:00:14,402
remain a member of Appello

819
01:00:15,570 --> 01:00:16,738
as she has always been.

820
01:00:49,312 --> 01:00:50,355
Ms. Nam.

821
01:00:55,527 --> 01:00:56,736
What brings you here at this hour?

822
01:01:02,117 --> 01:01:03,118
Did you run here?

823
01:01:06,663 --> 01:01:07,747
Yes.

824
01:01:10,208 --> 01:01:11,209
But it's cold.

825
01:01:29,686 --> 01:01:32,189
Mr. Kang. I...

826
01:01:33,231 --> 01:01:34,941
I don't want to quit.

827
01:01:40,906 --> 01:01:42,490
But why? You already submitted
your resignation.

828
01:01:46,578 --> 01:01:48,079
Because of you.

829
01:01:50,624 --> 01:01:52,876
You made me work
even outside the office.

830
01:01:53,835 --> 01:01:55,337
It's unfair.

831
01:01:58,924 --> 01:02:00,050
You said I'd remain

832
01:02:00,884 --> 01:02:01,927
a member of Appello

833
01:02:03,220 --> 01:02:05,263
as I have always been.

834
01:02:10,477 --> 01:02:11,603
I'm sorry...

835
01:02:15,398 --> 01:02:16,608
the official statement took so long.

836
01:02:19,611 --> 01:02:20,904
To repay your trust

837
01:02:21,529 --> 01:02:23,573
I'll dedicate myself to Appello.

838
01:02:28,745 --> 01:02:30,580
Because I'm a CEO

839
01:02:31,957 --> 01:02:33,750
I always have to hold back
before making a decision.

840
01:02:37,212 --> 01:02:38,672
I have to think twice

841
01:02:39,965 --> 01:02:41,007
and hesitate countless times.

842
01:02:43,885 --> 01:02:45,470
I'm not even as brave as you think.

843
01:02:49,474 --> 01:02:50,475
It must've been hard on you...

844
01:02:52,269 --> 01:02:53,353
hasn't it?

845
01:02:56,648 --> 01:02:57,691
No.

846
01:02:58,984 --> 01:03:01,569
I'm sorry.

847
01:03:04,239 --> 01:03:05,282
From now on

848
01:03:06,658 --> 01:03:08,285
I'm not going to hide
my feelings anymore.

849
01:03:08,910 --> 01:03:10,745
I'm going to be honest
about everything.

850
01:03:11,288 --> 01:03:13,039
I don't want to say

851
01:03:13,498 --> 01:03:15,333
that I won't blame you
even if you fire me...

852
01:03:17,002 --> 01:03:18,128
or that I'm okay.

853
01:03:20,714 --> 01:03:21,881
I missed Appello.

854
01:03:22,924 --> 01:03:25,760
I missed my job.

855
01:03:29,139 --> 01:03:30,181
And...

856
01:03:32,475 --> 01:03:33,727
what's more...

857
01:03:41,318 --> 01:03:44,112
I missed you.

858
01:03:52,203 --> 01:03:53,413
I think...

859
01:03:55,498 --> 01:03:56,666
I...

860
01:03:58,251 --> 01:04:01,338
like you, Mr. Kang.

861
01:05:09,030 --> 01:05:12,742
MY BIAS, MY BOSS

862
01:05:23,670 --> 01:05:27,715
"Making money by being a stalker fan.
What an easy life."

863
01:05:29,634 --> 01:05:31,302
Hey. How about this?

864
01:05:32,387 --> 01:05:35,722
It breaches both the Network Act
and criminal law.

865
01:05:35,723 --> 01:05:37,057
Request a takedown first.

866
01:05:37,058 --> 01:05:39,185
We need a warrant
to identify the person.

867
01:05:40,186 --> 01:05:42,396
Taking screenshots of everything.

868
01:05:42,397 --> 01:05:44,022
Good.

869
01:05:44,023 --> 01:05:47,025
Now we send
the notice to the platforms

870
01:05:47,026 --> 01:05:49,278
then the posts
will be deleted tonight.

871
01:05:49,279 --> 01:05:50,363
Okay.

872
01:05:50,947 --> 01:05:54,242
"The company must go down
for hiring a stalker."

873
01:05:55,452 --> 01:05:57,620
Screenshot that too.

874
01:05:59,539 --> 01:06:03,793
"Maybe the stalker is
gaslighting Lee Chan."

875
01:06:05,211 --> 01:06:07,338
I'm reporting it.

876
01:06:09,424 --> 01:06:12,427
"That's not a stalker.
She's living the dream life."

877
01:06:12,844 --> 01:06:14,721
"She even landed a job."

878
01:06:15,930 --> 01:06:17,599
Is that a compliment
or a hate comment?

879
01:06:18,808 --> 01:06:20,225
- Hey. Let that slide.
- Let it slide?

880
01:06:20,226 --> 01:06:21,227
Yeah.

881
01:06:23,980 --> 01:06:27,442
"I actually saw the stalker fan.
She wasn't that pretty."

882
01:06:35,783 --> 01:06:37,660
Delete that false information.

883
01:06:38,203 --> 01:06:39,871
She's pretty in person.

884
01:06:44,876 --> 01:06:49,797
FOR REAL

885
01:06:52,800 --> 01:06:54,636
Delete the false information.

886
01:06:54,886 --> 01:06:57,597
She's pretty for real.

887
01:06:59,516 --> 01:07:02,852
No matter how hard things get,
don't let go of my hand.

888
01:07:04,062 --> 01:07:05,604
This is crazy.

889
01:07:05,605 --> 01:07:07,272
Secret office romance rules.

890
01:07:07,273 --> 01:07:08,316
Da-reum.

891
01:07:09,150 --> 01:07:10,359
No touching.

892
01:07:10,360 --> 01:07:11,903
You look happy.

893
01:07:12,237 --> 01:07:13,696
Why Ha-gi and not me?

894
01:07:15,031 --> 01:07:17,200
It's the hottest topic
in fashion right now.

895
01:07:17,408 --> 01:07:19,618
The Creative Director's identity is
under wraps.

896
01:07:19,619 --> 01:07:20,870
Let's bring Han on board.

897
01:07:21,538 --> 01:07:23,121
She's on her way now.

898
01:07:23,122 --> 01:07:24,498
Do you need my help?

899
01:07:24,499 --> 01:07:26,501
See if you can win Ha-gi's heart.

900
01:07:27,835 --> 01:07:30,421
Nice to meet you, Mr. Kang Ha-gi.
